0..65 Comment "//! A natural-number operation can return quotient and remainder."
66..69 Comment "//!"
70..142 Comment "//! Rules define the operation through a helper that walks the dividend."
143..146 Comment "//!"
147..210 Comment "//! A closed division normalizes to its quotient and remainder."
211..289 Comment "//! A call labels each output port. A run can select one output. A pattern can"
290..333 Comment "//! bind both outputs in a different order."
334..337 Comment "//!"
338..392 Comment "//! - cites: [Baader-1998-term_rewriting_and_all_that]"
393..396 Comment "//!"
397..533 Comment "//! [Baader-1998-term_rewriting_and_all_that]: https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781139172752 \"Baader and Nipkow, Term Rewriting and All That\""
